  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"1023\">\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"801\"><strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"784\">Positive</strong> TLE1 expression:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"1023\">\n<li data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"862\">\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"862\">Commonly <strong data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"843\">seen in Synovial Sarcoma</strong> (nuclear staining)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"937\">\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"937\">Also occasionally positive in other tumors &rarr; <strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"937\">not entirely specific</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1023\">\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1023\">Should be interpreted <strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1023\">in correlation with histopathology and clinical context</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1123\">\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1045\"><strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1039\">Negative</strong> TLE1:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1123\">\n<li data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1088\">Reduces likelihood of Synovial Sarcoma</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1123\">\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1123\">Consider alternative diagnoses</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
